  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v8.4.0\n\n\t\tADDED\n\t\t- !A sigil: evaluates the content of variable A directly (block, function, string, list, record). Equivalent to A eval but more efficient — the object never lands on the stack as an intermediate value. Silent no-op for non-executable types.\n\t\t- Circular reference detection: the runtime now raises an error (with full cycle chain) instead of looping indefinitely when !A triggers a recursive evaluation chain.\n\t\t- --> in-place pipeline operator: applies a list of transformations directly to a referenced variable — e.g. (->upper butfirst butlast) --> &A. Fully transactional: a snapshot is restored automatically on error.\n\n\t\tCHANGED\n\t\t- AOT compatibility: the engine is now fully compatible with .NET Native AOT publishing. No behavioral changes.\n\t\t- ~13% speedup on the core execution loop.\n\t\t\n\t\tFull changelog: https://github.com/Sydney680928/mogwai/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md",
